Use io and list.

Define function combine taking candidates as a pointer to List of whole number, start as an unsigned number, remaining as a whole number, chosen as a pointer to List of whole number:
    If remaining is 0:
        Let chosen_count be count of chosen.
        For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to chosen_count - 1:
            Say list_get(chosen, i).
        Say "---".
        Give back.
    Let n be count of candidates.
    For every i from start to n - 1:
        Let value be list_get(candidates, i).
        If value is at most remaining:
            push value to chosen.
            combine(candidates, i, remaining - value, chosen).
            Let ignored be pop from chosen.
Done.

Let candidates be a list of 2, 3, 6, and 7.
Let chosen be an empty list of whole numbers.
combine(address of candidates, 0, 7, address of chosen).
list_free(address of chosen).
list_free(address of candidates).
Return 0.
